    "name": "Luna Hop",
    "steam_appid": 3387010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/3a725c7ca297bdfb7ca63672169dcae1.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/3a725c7ca297bdfb7ca63672169dcae1.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/3a725c7ca297bdfb7ca63672169dcae1.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a meteor struck the moon, Seoul fell into silence. The city lost its light and color, and daily life came to a quiet halt\u2014like scattered fragments left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luna, a timid rabbit hiding away in a rooftop room, discovers a fallen moon fragment in her yard. With that small spark of courage, she steps outside for the first time and begins a journey to restore the city\u2019s missing colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna Hop is a 3D narrative adventure set in a reimagined modern Seoul.</strong> <br>As Luna, you\u2019ll collect moon fragments, bring color back to faded spaces, and explore a city that feels both unfamiliar and familiar.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey of Small Courage That Colors the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Bring color back to the city:\u00a0</strong>As Luna brushes past forgotten objects, color slowly returns. Each step leaves behind a quiet ripple of change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/5ac3eb99af2824c5296a83a15f7c5dfc.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/5ac3eb99af2824c5296a83a15f7c5dfc.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/5ac3eb99af2824c5296a83a15f7c5dfc.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Collect the moon\u2019s fragments :\u00a0</strong>Solve puzzles and gather scattered pieces. The more you find, the deeper Luna\u2019s journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/8f9b064edd09087b7cfcdff716f35f9d.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/8f9b064edd09087b7cfcdff716f35f9d.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/8f9b064edd09087b7cfcdff716f35f9d.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore layered landscapes:\u00a0</strong>Walk through rooftops, alleys, bridges, and streams. See the city through Luna\u2019s quiet and curious eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/ba547297bae2507f1b03f807ea9bcccf.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/ba547297bae2507f1b03f807ea9bcccf.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/ba547297bae2507f1b03f807ea9bcccf.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0d <strong>Pass by others in silence:\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Though Luna speaks no words, moments of connection quietly unfold as she moves through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/4786696c209bf27e5b2d974e708f5c45.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/4786696c209bf27e5b2d974e708f5c45.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/4786696c209bf27e5b2d974e708f5c45.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Complete the journey:\u00a0</strong>Return the fragments to the moon, and discover how small acts of courage can bring the world back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/b1737a9320f7a113df3e81fdc54b382f.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/b1737a9320f7a113df3e81fdc54b382f.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/b1737a9320f7a113df3e81fdc54b382f.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/3a725c7ca297bdfb7ca63672169dcae1.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/3a725c7ca297bdfb7ca63672169dcae1.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/3a725c7ca297bdfb7ca63672169dcae1.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a meteor struck the moon, Seoul fell into silence. The city lost its light and color, and daily life came to a quiet halt\u2014like scattered fragments left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luna, a timid rabbit hiding away in a rooftop room, discovers a fallen moon fragment in her yard. With that small spark of courage, she steps outside for the first time and begins a journey to restore the city\u2019s missing colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna Hop is a 3D narrative adventure set in a reimagined modern Seoul.</strong> <br>As Luna, you\u2019ll collect moon fragments, bring color back to faded spaces, and explore a city that feels both unfamiliar and familiar.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey of Small Courage That Colors the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Bring color back to the city:\u00a0</strong>As Luna brushes past forgotten objects, color slowly returns. Each step leaves behind a quiet ripple of change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/5ac3eb99af2824c5296a83a15f7c5dfc.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/5ac3eb99af2824c5296a83a15f7c5dfc.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/5ac3eb99af2824c5296a83a15f7c5dfc.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Collect the moon\u2019s fragments :\u00a0</strong>Solve puzzles and gather scattered pieces. The more you find, the deeper Luna\u2019s journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/8f9b064edd09087b7cfcdff716f35f9d.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/8f9b064edd09087b7cfcdff716f35f9d.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/8f9b064edd09087b7cfcdff716f35f9d.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore layered landscapes:\u00a0</strong>Walk through rooftops, alleys, bridges, and streams. See the city through Luna\u2019s quiet and curious eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/ba547297bae2507f1b03f807ea9bcccf.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/ba547297bae2507f1b03f807ea9bcccf.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/ba547297bae2507f1b03f807ea9bcccf.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0d <strong>Pass by others in silence:\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Though Luna speaks no words, moments of connection quietly unfold as she moves through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/4786696c209bf27e5b2d974e708f5c45.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/4786696c209bf27e5b2d974e708f5c45.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/4786696c209bf27e5b2d974e708f5c45.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Complete the journey:\u00a0</strong>Return the fragments to the moon, and discover how small acts of courage can bring the world back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/b1737a9320f7a113df3e81fdc54b382f.poster.avif?t=1752128348\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/b1737a9320f7a113df3e81fdc54b382f.webm?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387010/extras/b1737a9320f7a113df3e81fdc54b382f.mp4?t=1752128348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
